2Ki 5:1 , Naaman, by the report of a captive maid, is sent to Samaria to be cured of his leprosy;
2Ki 5:8 , Elisha, sending him to Jordan cures him;
2Ki 5:15 , He refusing Naaman's gifts grants him some of the earth;
2Ki 5:20 , Gehazi, abusing his master's name unto Naaman, is smitten with leprosy.
